  "description": "Async .NET client for the MisarReach outreach API: lead finder across 23 sources, CRM contacts, deals and pipeline, multi-step campaigns over email, SMS, WhatsApp, web push and social DMs, plus an AI sales agent and autopilot. 94 methods on one MisarReachClient cover every documented endpoint. Server-Sent Events carry live lead-search progress and synthesise a terminal event for a job that already finished; plan caps surface as a typed UpgradeRequiredException (HTTP 402, upgrade:true) that is never retried, while genuinely transient statuses retry with exponential back-off. Authenticates with an mrk_ key; targets net8.0 on System.Text.Json with no third-party dependencies.",
